r email note and permissions heading by <a href=\"https://github.com/joshmgross\"><code class=\"notranslate\">@​joshmgross</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/checkout/pull/2044\">actions/checkout#2044</a></li>\n<li>Update README.md by <a href=\"https://github.com/nebuk89\"><code class=\"notranslate\">@​nebuk89</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/checkout/pull/2194\">actions/checkout#2194</a></li>\n<li>Update CODEOWNERS for actions by <a href=\"https://github.com/TingluoHuang\"><code class=\"notranslate\">@​TingluoHuang</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/checkout/pull/2224\">actions/checkout#2224</a></li>\n<li>Update package dependencies by <a href=\"https://github.com/salmanmkc\"><code class=\"notranslate\">@​salmanmkc</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/checkout/pull/2236\">actions/checkout#2236</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">v4.2.2</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">url-helper.ts</code> now leverages well-known environment variables by <a href=\"https://github.com/jww3\"><code class=\"notranslate\">@​jww3</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/checkout/pull/1941\">actions/checkout#1941</a></li>\n<li>Expand unit test coverage for <code class=\"notranslate\">isGhes</code> by <a href=\"https://github.com/jww3\"><code class=\"notranslate\">@​jww3</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/checkout/pull/1946\">actions/checkout#1946</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">v4.2.1</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Check out other refs/* by commit if provided, fall back to ref by <a href=\"https://github.com/orhantoy\"><code class=\"notranslate\">@​orhantoy</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/checkout/pull/1924\">actions/checkout#1924</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">v4.2.0</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add Ref and Commit outputs by <a href=\"https://github.com/lucacome\"><code class=\"notranslate\">@​